        <mxCell id="0oY0yhGFXMviBRu67rsU-15" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Solution Screen&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;This section allows users to filter the Sales Order Report output. Users can restrict results by specifying a range of Sales Document numbers (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;172&quot;&gt;VBAK-VBELN&lt;/code&gt;), creation/order dates (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;207&quot;&gt;VBAK-AUDAT&lt;/code&gt;), or a specific Sales Document Type (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;255&quot;&gt;VBAK-AUART&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
