        <mxCell id="0oY0yhGFXMviBRu67rsU-49" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;ALV&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The ABAP List Viewer (ALV) grid displays the aggregated sales order data based on the selection parameters. It maps order header details (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;166&quot;&gt;VBAK&lt;/code&gt;) alongside item-level materials (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;204&quot;&gt;VBAP&lt;/code&gt;) and localized material descriptions (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;247&quot;&gt;MAKT&lt;/code&gt;) into a clean, interactive tabular report.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="580" x="1120" y="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0oY0yhGFXMviBRu67rsU-50" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Columns:&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Order number: VBAK-VBELN&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Order date: VBAK-AUDAT&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sales Document Type: VBAK-AUART&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Material: VBAP-MATNR&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Description: MAKT-MAKTX&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="250" x="860" y="370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
